---
layout: base.njk
wide: true
title: "Impossible Pictures"
search_title: "Impossible Pictures: a gallery of machine-made art about a world with AI"
description: "A gallery of things that could not exist and could not be photographed: adverts from 2050, banknotes from nowhere, courtrooms run by fruit machines. All made by a machine. None of it is evidence of anything."
permalink: /art/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<header class="museum-head">
  <p class="kicker">A gallery · {{ art.length }} pictures · new ones most weeks</p>
  <h1>Impossible Pictures</h1>
  <p class="standfirst">Things that could not exist and could not be photographed. Some hang beside an article and argue with it. Some belong to nothing and are here for their own sake. Every one was made by a machine, to an idea written by another machine. None shows a real place, person or event.</p>
</header>

<div class="hang">
{%- for a in art | reverse %}
  <figure id="{{ a.slug }}">
    <img src="{{ ('/art/' + a.file) | url }}" alt="{{ a.alt }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ a.width }}" height="{{ a.height }}">
    <figcaption>
      <span class="hang-title">{% if a.standalone %}{{ a.title }}{% else %}{{ a.concept }}{% endif %}</span>
      {%- if a.standalone %}<span class="hang-idea">{{ a.caption or a.concept }}</span>{% endif %}
      <span class="eyebrow">{{ a.tradition }}{% if a.post_url %} · made for <a href="{{ a.post_url | url }}">{{ a.title }}</a>{% endif %} · {{ a.date }}</span>
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
{%- else %}
  <p class="eyebrow">Nothing hung yet.</p>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
